# Release signing secrets live OUTSIDE this folder entirely (project root,
# not android/) — `expo prebuild` deletes and regenerates this whole
# directory from scratch on every run (it doesn't respect gitignore, it
# just wipes everything untracked here first), which already destroyed one
# copy of the release keystore during this same session. See the root
# .gitignore and android/app/build.gradle's signingConfigs comment.
